      "title": "RTP dialogs: Fix: Coloring of QTreeWidgetItem do not work",
      "message": "RTP dialogs: Fix: Coloring of QTreeWidgetItem do not work\n\nrtp_player_dialog and rtp_stream_dialog are colorizing shown stream\nrows. Colors stopped to work somehow, but are shown in manuals from\npast.\n\nThe patch fixes the issue.\n\nPlease, backport it to 3.6 and later branches.\n",
      "author_name": "Jirka Novak",
      "author_email": "j.novak@netsystem.cz",
      "authored_date": "2022-09-25T18:27:17.000+02:00",
